	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Que cupis scire de colloquio et eius progressu, non committam te <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>nescire, que sciam, tamen pauca, sed meliora malim.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Cum <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ad finem augusti vix tandem utreque partes congregarentur <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Wormaciae, legati, quos dux <persName>Fridericus Saxo</persName> miserat, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>aperuerunt nostris, qui confessione Augusta(na) constant, principis <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>sui mandata, ne cum eis prius in colloquium consentiant, quam subscripse<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>rint condemnationibus suis, quas Ihene consentientibus principib<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>us suis exercuissent damnantes hereses Zwinglianam, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Osiand(ricam), adiaphoristicam, Maioricam, anabaptisticam et <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Swencfeldianam etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Qui hoc malum <persName>Palladio</persName> protulissent <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>erant d. <persName ref="p6469">Erhardus Snephius</persName>, <persName ref="p3046">Victorinus Strigelius</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>et politicus d. <persName>Basilius Monner</persName>, quibus adiunctus d. <persName>Martinus <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Ioachi(mus</persName>) <placeName ref="l1041">Brunsvicensis</placeName>, acerrimus <persName ref="p2301">Osiandri</persName> osor, qui ob <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>factiosam vehementiam <placeName>Borussia</placeName> eiectus dudum fuerat.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Nostri hanc contentionem deprecabantur et preiudicia partium <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>non consentiunt nec auditorum etiam renuebant et orabant, ut <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>his suspensis et reiectis in alia tempora, loca et personas <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>vel post colloquium publicum, ut communis controversia, quam cum <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>pontificiis, propter quam asciti sint, agantur communi, utili <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>et honestiore opera.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Eius rei gratia princeps noster illustrissim<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>us scribit et deprecatur ad <placeName ref="l749">Saxones</placeName> principes, ne dissolvatur <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>colloquium commune propter privatas contentiones suorum, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>mittit d. <persName>Theodorum Snephium</persName>, ut partem mitigaret et <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>a pertinacia abduceret.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Sed omnia frustra.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Tandem <placeName ref="l749">Saxones</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>principes illos suos quos, dixi, revocant, ut contemptis nostris <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>redeant domum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Quod fecerunt non sine ignominiosa turpitudine.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Nam susceptis literis mandantibus discessum eos ad praesidem et pontificios <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>audio retulisse, in quibus caussas revocationis iustas scribebant <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>principes eas sibi videri et sperant probari ab istis, qua <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>nostri lapsi fuissent in non ferendas hereses, quas vel <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>concilient vel introducere dissimulatione conentur aut nolunt <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>damnantibus consentire, non permisisse suis, ut colloquantur <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>cum talibus, nec recipiant, quod in congressu colloquii constituantur etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/>His expositis coram pontificiis et recusatis mox insalutatis <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>aliis abierunt.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Nostri adhuc haerent rubore et pudore suffusi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/>Pontificii se perfunctos putant officio legationis suae, ut progredia<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>tur colloquium detrectant abeunte bona parte principis et <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>recusante hanc actionem; nos esse discordes, quam concordiam aut <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>reconciliationem sperare liceat, ignorari.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Que ad nos <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>relata fuere potui ad te scribere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Expectamus propediem <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>d. <persName>Iacobum Beurlin</persName>, quem optimus noster princeps hinc superi<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>oribus diebus eo ablegaverat, ut dissolventibus suppetias ferret; <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>qui si venerit, plura cognoscemus.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Dolet mihi, et pii <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>tristantur ob hanc confusionem; erat enim magna spes multorum <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>principum fieri consensum in <placeName ref="l18">Augustanam</placeName> confessionem et ideo <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>animorum coniunctiones.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Sed adversarius per ambitionem, ut <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>est superbus, et discordię spiritus invidit prosperiorem <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>successum.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Saxones illi putant ad se pertinere principatum ut <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>electoratum et puritatem doctrinae, quae coepit <placeName ref="l558">Wittenbergae</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z20"/>Qua id faciant fortuna, forte tali quali modestiae et <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>concordiae studio.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Habes, que nos flagellant et precipue <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>optimum principem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Sed et vulnus accepit triste <persName>Palatinus</persName> elector, n<lb xml:id="p2z23"/>am m. <persName>Heinricus Stola</persName> et politicus senator, cuius nomen <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>non teneo, ingressi balneas correpti illico letali ęgritudine <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>reportati <placeName ref="l210">Heidelbergam</placeName> postridie obdormierunt; putant <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>intoxicatos, sed cui hanc culpam deferunt, non audio.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="author">[Von hier an Autogr. von <persName ref="p1010">Matth. Erb</persName>:]</note>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z27"/>Haec ex autographo epistole <persName>Ioannis Eisemanni</persName>, que redd<lb xml:id="p2z28"/>ita est 8. novembris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Propter valetudinem haec vix in grabbatulo potui s<lb xml:id="p2z29"/>cribere.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Ora pro me.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse fehlt, dagegen ist auf dem diesem Schreiben vorangehenden Blatt 252b unten von <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> bemerkt:]</note>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Sequentem epistolam misit ad me d. <lb xml:id="p2z30"/><persName ref="p1010">Matthias Erbius</persName>, pastor <placeName ref="l411">Rychenwylensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z31"/>in <placeName ref="l632">Alsatia</placeName>, mense novembri 1557.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
